  "title": "Open Accessund Und Neue Publikationsformen",
  "language": "en",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "On 25 November 2013, the Scientific Staff Associations of D-MTEC (ScSt@MTEC) and D-GESS (ASST) together with ETH-Bibliothek would like to invite you to an information and discussion event about Open Access and scholarly publishing.\n\nMonday 25 November 2013, 1:00pm – 2:30pm ETH Zurich, Building IFW, Haldeneggsteig 4, Room C 31\n\nOrganisers: ETH-Bibliothek, Associations of Scientific Staff at D-MTEC and D-GESS\n\nPresenter: Barbara Hirschmann, E-Publishing Office, ETH-Bibliothek\n\nTopics: - overview of the latest developments in scientific publishing - possibilities, potentials and challenges of Open Access publishing - Open Access strategies of ETH Zurich and significant research funding organisations - copyright issues that arise when concluding contracts with publishers or when making journal articles freely available on the Internet\n\nAfter the presentation there will be time for questions and discussions.\n\nThe following video by phdcomics.com provides a thematic introduction to Open-Access."
    }
  ],
